cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "benchmarks-synthetic-data-generators: a benchmark suite for synthetic RDF data generators"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark suite for synthetic RDF data generators. Every generator runs in
  its own Docker container; a single command builds the images, generates the
  datasets, computes the metrics and renders the charts for the
  controllability (E2), conformance (E4) and FHIR case-study (E5) experiments.
